IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wy-income-tax`

-- Wyoming income tax -- cases from the individual's seat. Expected values written by hand from W.S. 39-7-101 and 39-12-101.

-- No state income tax (39-7-101 repealed; nothing levies one).
#ASSERT NOT (`Do I owe Wyoming income tax`)
-- No local income or earnings tax: the field is preempted (39-12-101).
#ASSERT `Can this government tax my wages` `a county` EQUALS `no: the field is preempted by the state, and no county, city, town or other political subdivision may impose, levy or collect such a tax (W.S. 39-12-101)`
#ASSERT `Can this government tax my wages` `a city or town` EQUALS `no: the field is preempted by the state, and no county, city, town or other political subdivision may impose, levy or collect such a tax (W.S. 39-12-101)`
#ASSERT `Can this government tax my wages` `another political subdivision` EQUALS `no: the field is preempted by the state, and no county, city, town or other political subdivision may impose, levy or collect such a tax (W.S. 39-12-101)`
-- The state keeps the power but has not used it: no state tax either.
#ASSERT `Can this government tax my wages` `the state` EQUALS `no: the state keeps the power to tax income but levies no income tax (W.S. 39-12-101; 39-7-101 repealed)`
